  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Beam" id="5b60-9420-d5d3-02d5" hidden="false">
      <description>After designating a target, draw a line from the firing model to the target unit. If the attack is in range, each unit the line passes through also takes a number of attacks equal to the weapon&apos;s profile. A beam is stopped by and does not extent past a vehicle or monstrous creature that it hits.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
